  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Hello! I am Mia. Today I go to the zoo with Dad. Look at the picture. This is an elephant. It is big and gray. It has a long nose. It has two big ears. An elephant is very big, and it eats fruit. I love elephants!",
      "Now look at the water. These are fish. Fish live in water. The fish are orange and white. A small fish is next to a big fish. They swim and swim. I can see fish with long tails. Dad takes a photo of the fish.",
      "Now it is lunch. We sit under a tree. This is my rice. This is a sausage. The sausage is small and brown. This is a tomato, and it is red. Dad has fish and rice. My lunch has a lot of rice. Dad asks, \"Is the rice good?\" Yes, it is very good! Do you like rice? What is in your lunch?"
    ],
    "summary": "Mia goes to the zoo with Dad. She shows an elephant, some fish, and the food in her lunch: rice, a sausage, and a tomato.",
